    "When the same service charges twice in one day. Can be noisy — leave off unless you've seen duplicates." : {
      "comment" : "Settings Autopilot duplicates toggle sublabel (design review D6 default-off rationale).",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同一个服务一天内被扣款两次。可能有点吵,除非你真的遇到过重复扣款,否则建议保持关闭。"
